n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Test1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Equals</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector3D</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  z</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dotProduct2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.y;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isOrthogonal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dotProduct2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a, b)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1e-10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在游戏开发中，几何公理直接对应着物理引擎的基本假设。例如，碰撞检测依赖于&quot;两点确定一条线段&quot;（公设一）和距离度量的一致性（公设四的推广）。当游戏世界从平面扩展到球面（如星球模拟），就需要切换到椭圆几何体系。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用领域</th>\n<th>使用的公理思想</th>\n<th>具体技术</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>形式化验证</td>\n<td>公理系统一致性</td>\n<td>Coq, Lean, Isabelle</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型系统</td>\n<td>类型推理规则</td>\n<td>Hindley-Milner, TypeScript</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碰撞检测</td>\n<td>距离与相交公理</td>\n<td>SAT, GJK 算法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地图投影</td>\n<td>曲面几何公设</td>\n<td>Mercator, Lambert 投影</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图神经网络</td>\n<td>双曲空间嵌入</td>\n<td>Poincaré 嵌入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>公理化方法是从<strong>不证自明的基本命题</strong>出发，通过逻辑推理构建完整理论体系的方法</li>\n<li>欧几里得五大公设构成平面几何的基础，其中前四条简洁直观，第五条（平行公设）复杂且独特</li>\n<li>希尔伯特重新严格化了欧几里得体系，将其组织为 5 组 20 条公理，满足一致性、独立性和完备性</li>\n<li>否定平行公设产生了<strong>双曲几何</strong>（负曲率）和<strong>椭圆几何</strong>（正曲率），它们在网络科学和地理计算中有重要应用</li>\n<li>公理化思维在计算机科学中的体现包括：类型系统设计、形式化验证、Curry-Howard 同构</li>\n<li>理解公理化方法有助于程序员设计更严谨的接口契约和类型系统，从根本上提高代码的正确性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><p>公理化方法既是数学内部的基石，也是逻辑学与哲学反复审视的对象：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"geometric-proofs\">几何证明方法</a>（本章）——公理体系如何支撑实际的证明推导</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../linear-algebra/vectors-and-matrices/vector-spaces\">向量空间与公理体系</a>——同一套「公理→定理」范式在代数结构上的体现</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../mathematical-logic/proof-theory/natural-deduction\">自然演绎</a>——公理化推理在形式逻辑中的精确化</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-mathematics/foundational-schools/formalism-hilbert-godel\">形式主义、希尔伯特纲领与哥德尔</a>——希尔伯特对欧氏几何的严格化及其哲学余波</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"公理与公设","id":"公理与公设"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"欧几里得五大公设","id":"欧几里得五大公设"},{"level":2,"text":"公理化方法的逻辑结构","id":"公理化方法的逻辑结构"},{"level":2,"text":"平行公设与非欧几何","id":"平行公设与非欧几何"},{"level":2,"text":"公理化方法在计算机科学中的应用","id":"公理化方法在计算机科学中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"三角形与多边形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/euclidean-geometry/triangles-polygons"}}